DESCRIPTION:Possible weather balloon launches to support global weather fo
 recasting and research. Rarely more than one per day\, and balloons are u
 sually released at either 8 a.m.\, 2 p.m.\, or 8 p.m. Including setup and
  data collection time\, each launch takes approximately 2 hours.\nMore in
 formation about the program at https://go.iu.edu/weatherballoon\n\nHosted
  by: Earth and Atmospheric Sciences Department\n\nAdditional Information 
 can be found at: https://beinvolved.indiana.edu/event/12445563
