 to help you relax\, get creative\, and celebrate making it through the ye
 ar. Come make something cute\, snap some pics\, and soak up all the good 
 end-of-semester vibes!\n\nHosted by: Indiana Memorial Union Board\, India
 na Memorial Union\, Student Involvement and Leadership Center\n\nAddition
 al Information can be found at: https://beinvolved.indiana.edu/event/1237
 1251
